
title: main_start
---
<<declare $MY_NAME= string("林奈")>>
<<play_bgm "lake_happy2">>
<<play_whitenoise "bgWater_springwater1">>
<<set_background "背景">>

<<set_character_person Player {$MY_NAME} peace_1>>
<<set_character_person Character "伊兰莉特" peace_2>>
（鲜花簇拥着我们，溪水潺潺。） #line:09f9855 
<<set_character_sprite "{$MY_NAME}" "peace_1">>
<<set_character_sprite "伊兰莉特" "peace_1">>
伊兰莉特:花开得真好。#sfx_Character_主角2_好啊
（岩壁上有一大簇正盛放的小苍兰，伊兰莉特最喜欢那些花了。） #line:006d230 
<<set_character_sprite "{$MY_NAME}" "happy">>
<<set_character_sprite "伊兰莉特" "saying">>
伊兰莉特:把它们做成花环戴在你头上，唔...... #line:0d9e904 
<<set_character_sprite "伊兰莉特" "happy">>
伊兰莉特:想想那个画面，一定非常可爱吧。#sfx_Character_主角2_真棒 
（伊兰莉特边说边爬上一根横垂的树枝，想去摘下岩壁上的花朵。） #line:05659c5 
<<set_character_sprite "{$MY_NAME}" "saying">>
{$MY_NAME}:伊兰莉特，注意安-- #line:0f1a741 
<<stop_bgm>>
<<clear_character_person Character>>
（树枝折断了） #line:0d7301f 
<<set_character_sprite "{$MY_NAME}" "peace_2">>
{$MY_NAME}:！！！ #line:0c4c660 
<<play_bgm lake_sadStrong>>
（她连人带花一起落下那呜咽的溪水里。） #line:0ef6cfc 
<<set_background "纯黑">>
<<clear_character_person "Player">>
<<clear_character_person "Character">>

(..........) #line:07a7a58 
(..........) #line:007dd97 
<<jump room1_1>>
